      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING KIMELI (2) goes very well at the distance with four wins and a placing from eight starts. Was out of placings last time (30.28) at Q Parklands in a Grade 4/5, finishing fifth and beaten 9 lengths. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. WYNDRA ALL SMOKE (8) was the fastest winner on the program last time out, running away to score by half a length (30.25) at Rockhampton. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. JILL'S JULIETTE (7) boasts a strong record this course with three wins and three minors from six tries. Recorded a nose win (25.67) in a Grade 5 last time at this track. Looks one of the chances. SCARCITY (4) looks an each-way chance.",
